      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:zwvpqq'
    '|a||How sure are we? That ownership follows these costs across industries: mostly agreed. Why worker ownership is so rare: contested.':
